{"id":"dc4cd434aa3ff90f","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-metric-closed-code.md","title":"Closed Sets via Codes for Their Open Complements","display":"df-metric-closed-code — Closed Sets via Codes for Their Open Complements","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-metric-closed-code","aliases":["62-df-metric-closed-code"],"display":"df-metric-closed-code — Closed Sets via Codes for Their Open Complements","depends_on":["[[62-df-metric-open-code]]","[[62-df-metric-point]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definition II.5.12","source_pages":[83],"source_pdf_pages":[101]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-metric-closed-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-metric-closed-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-metric-closed-code — Closed Sets via Codes for Their Open Complements"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"166ca19259ae8ea6\" href=\"?note=166ca19259ae8ea6\" title=\"62-df-metric-open-code\">62-df-metric-open-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1305c4b57e562000\" href=\"?note=1305c4b57e562000\" title=\"62-df-metric-point\">62-df-metric-point</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definition II.5.12"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>83</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>101</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>点见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1305c4b57e562000\" href=\"?note=1305c4b57e562000\" title=\"62-df-metric-point\">62-df-metric-point</a>；开集代码及成员关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"166ca19259ae8ea6\" href=\"?note=166ca19259ae8ea6\" title=\"62-df-metric-open-code\">62-df-metric-open-code</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A=(A,D)\">\\(\\mathcal A=(A,D)\\)</span>。符号 C 在本原子用作其开补集的代码，同一数集作为开码或闭码的角色由成员记号区分。上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cl}\">\\(\\mathrm{cl}\\)</span> 是下式的闭码角色标签。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metric\\text{-}closed\\text{-}code}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{ClosedCode}_{\\mathcal A}(C)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{OpenCode}_{\\mathcal A}(C),\\\\\nx\\in^{\\mathrm{cl}}_{\\mathcal A}C&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Pt}_{\\mathcal A}(x)\\land\\mathsf{ClosedCode}_{\\mathcal A}(C)\\land\\neg(x\\in_{\\mathcal A}C).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metric\\text{-}closed\\text{-}code}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{ClosedCode}_{\\mathcal A}(C)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{OpenCode}_{\\mathcal A}(C),\\\\\nx\\in^{\\mathrm{cl}}_{\\mathcal A}C&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Pt}_{\\mathcal A}(x)\\land\\mathsf{ClosedCode}_{\\mathcal A}(C)\\land\\neg(x\\in_{\\mathcal A}C).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>闭集成员关系为 Π⁰₁。C 本身存放被排除的基本开球，并非全部闭集点的集合。空 C 作为闭码表示整个完成空间，作为开码则表示空集；不能混用这两种角色。来源采用书中的负信息表示，没有引入一个额外的闭集稠密序列。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Definition II.5.12；纸面页 83；PDF 页 101。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-metric-open-code","status":"resolved","id":"166ca19259ae8ea6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-metric-open-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-metric-point","stat